'''Hanbei''' (Japanese: '''ハンベエ''') is a [[Warlord]] in [[Pokémon Conquest]]. 

He, along with [[Kanbei]], is one of [[Hideyoshi]]'s personal advisors and junior Warlords. Despite his appearance, Hanbei is the older of the two.

==In the games==
[[File:Junior Warlord Competition.png|thumb|right|250px|[[Muneshige]], [[Magoichi]], [[Okuni]], [[Tadakatsu]], [[Kanetsugu]], [[Yukimura]], [[Gracia]], and Hanbei]]
[[File:Hanbei Kanbei Chess.png|thumb|right|250px|Hanbei and [[Kanbei]] playing chess.]]
{{Spoilers}}
Hanbei and Kanbei do not appear at all during {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|The Legend of Ransei}}, making their first appearance during Hideyoshi's story: {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|Happily Ever After}}. With their help, Hideyoshi eventually brings Ransei together as one peaceful nation.

In Hanbei's story, {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|The Reluctant Genius}}, Hideyoshi chooses Hanbei to represent [[Ignis]]. He is also in Kanbei's army at the beginning of Kanbei's story; {{DL|List of Pokémon Conquest stories|The Visionary's Quest}}.

